  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The secret to this dish is toasting the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fideo",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fideo"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " noodles dry in the pan before any liquid goes in. That step adds a nutty depth you cannot get any other way. Then a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sofrito",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sofrito"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " base and saffron broth give the dish its colour and warmth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dissolve the saffron in a tablespoon of hot water before adding it to the pan. It releases much more flavour that way."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
